## Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1: MVP (Weeks 1-2)

**Goal:** Prove concept with one supplier's invoice type

**Tasks:**

- Set up Gemini API integration and authentication
- Build PDF upload and processing pipeline
- Extract data from 5 sample invoices from primary supplier
- Build data validation layer
- Manually test ACSoft automation (PyWinAuto script for one invoice)
- Create simple web interface for upload

**Deliverable:** Working end-to-end demo with one invoice type

### Phase 2: Enhancement (Week 3)

**Goal:** Support multiple invoice formats and improve robustness

**Tasks:**

- Collect invoices from all regular suppliers
- Train Gemini extractor on diverse formats
- Expand mapping rules for all item categories
- Add comprehensive error handling
- Build audit logging system
- Create monitoring dashboard

**Deliverable:** Production-ready system for all current suppliers

### Phase 3: Polish & Documentation (Week 4)

**Goal:** Make system maintainable and user-friendly

**Tasks:**

- Performance optimization
- Create user manual for mom
- Document troubleshooting procedures
- Set up automated daily backups
- Create admin interface for updating supplier mappings
- Load testing with high-volume invoice batches

**Deliverable:** Fully documented, ready for daily use

