## Risk Analysis & Mitigation

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|------|----------|-----------|
| ACSoft UI changes after updates | Medium | Keep detailed element locators; add screenshot-based backup detection |
| Gemini API downtime | Low | Cache extracted data locally; allow manual fallback data entry |
| Invoice format variation | Medium | Collect diverse samples upfront; add user feedback loop to improve extraction |
| Accidental data loss | High | Daily local backups; version control of all invoices processed |
| PyWinAuto element detection failure | Low | Implement PyAutoGUI fallback with image recognition |
| Mom's concerns about automation | High | Clear "Review before save" screen; detailed audit logs; gradual rollout |

